      "title": "Jersey Shore Blow-Out at the 2010 MTV Movie Awards",
      "season": 0,
      "episode": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "released": "2010-06-06T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "As a pre-award ceremony special, MTV aired \"Jersey Shore Blow-Out at the 2010 MTV Movie\n\nAwards.\" Viewers were treated to the premiere of Enrique Iglesias's music video for \"I Like It,\" which features the cast of Jersey Shore. In the video, the cast receives VIP passes to an Iglesias concert\n\n, a perk that comes with their newly acquired fame. Mike \"The Situation,\" Pauly D, and Snooki gather together to fist-pump to the music, a dance style they made famous in Season 1. Not surprisingly, Ronnie dances with only the bottom three buttons of his dress shirt buttoned, Pauly D neglects to button any buttons on his shirt, and \"The Situation\" refuses to wear a shirt at all.",
